# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (—, U+2014) or `&mdash;` in anything we write for this project or any other app we build together.

Use a period, comma, colon, or hyphen instead.

```
Bad:  Expand a folder here — the rest of the tree stays visible.
Good: Expand a folder here. The rest of the tree stays visible.

Bad:  empty cell as '—'
Good: empty cell as '-'
```
